            "sid": "DEU 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa waenderera kugomba achiamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.20.1+JOS.20.2+JOS.20.3+JOS.20.4+JOS.20.5+JOS.20.6+JOS.20.7+JOS.20.8+JOS.20.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Joshuwa 20:1–9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wakati Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, ndiphoangamiza mataifa ganjina ambago tsi zao andakuphani mwimwi, na ndiphoazola na msagale kpwenye midzi yao na nyumba zao, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dzitengereni midzi mihahu kpwenye tsi ambayo Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu andakuphani muimiliki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsi iyo ambayo Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu anakuphani ikale yenu, iganyeni seemu tahu. Chila seemu indakala na mudzi mmwenga, namwi mundatengeza njira za kuelekeya midzi hiyo, ili yeyesi ndiyeolaga mutu bila kumanya achimbirire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ichikala mutu akaolaga myawe bila ya kumanya mutu ambaye kana dzana naye, anaweza kuchimbirira kpwenye mudzi mmwengawapho ili ativye maishage. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa mfwano mutu aphiye na myawe tsakani kpwendakata kuni. Wakati anakata muhi, mbadzo itsomoke kula kpwenye mphiniwe na imuolage yuya wanjina, mutu hiye anaweza kuchimbirira kpwenye mudzi mmwengawapho ili kutivya maishage. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Napho mudzi wa kuchimbirira ni mmwenga bahi unaweza ukakala kure kpwa muolagadzi. Hipho hiye mwenye kuriphiza chisasi, kpwa tsukizi nyinji anaweza kumzoresa muolagadzi, akamgbwira na kumuolaga. Hiye muolagadzi andakala akaonerwa mana kala kana uadui na ye mutu achiyefwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndiyo mana nakuamuruni mtenge midzi mihahu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tsona napho Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, andapanula miphaka ya tsi yenu, dza arivyoapira akare enu na achikuphani tsi yosi ambayo walaga kuapha akare enu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaga andagahenda, ichikala mundagbwira amuri hizi zosi ninazokuphani hivi rero, yani kummendza Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu na kuhenda vyo alondavyo iye wakati wosi. Mwenyezi Mlungu achihenda vivyo, mundaenjereza midzi yanjina mihahu ya kuchimbirira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundahenda hivyo sedze mukaolaga mutu asiyekala na kosa kpwenye tsi yenu ambayo Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, andakuphani ikale yenu, ili msikale na kosa ra kuolaga mutu asiye na kosa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ela mutu achimmena myawe halafu achidziiya-iya, achimshambuliya achimlumiza hadi achimuolaga, chisha achimbirire mudzi mmwenga wa midzi hiyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hipho atumia a mudzi hinyo andahuma atu amtuluze hiko na kumlavya kpwa mwenye kuriphiza chisasi cha umwagadzi milatso, aolagbwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Msimuonere mbazi, ela mundasisa uyi wa kuolaga mutu asiyekala na kosa ko Iziraeli, kusudi mphahe kusagala kpwa amani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
